sing, the input is decomposed to NFD and the combining accent marks (`\\u0300–\\u036f`) are removed. That turns `è` into `e` and `û` into `u`, so the existing regex only sees plain letters.\n\nI also made two small additions:\n- **Test** (`test/index.test.js`): added `slugify('Crème brûlée') === 'creme-brulee'`.\n- **Changelog** (`CHANGELOG.md`): added a \"Fixed\" entry under `[Unreleased]`. Remove it if you'd rather write that yourself.\n\nNothing is committed. Characters with no decomposition (for example `ß` or `ø`) still become dashes; say if you want those transliterated too.","ttft_ms":1706,"type":"result","duration_ms":10285,"uuid":"32febddf-c287-49d3-aec0-be9dcac20012","ttft_stream_ms":1288,"time_to_request_ms":423,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":365,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":11,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_append":1,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":4,"init_frame_send":2,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":2,"message_prep":2,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":4,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":12,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":1,"request_build":5},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":2,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":97,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":208,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":129,"process_rss_mib_result":229,"process_anon_mib_result":137,"process_peak_rss_mib":234,"process_cpu_ms_turn":841,"process_wall_ms_turn":10285,"tool_pool_build_count":3,"tool_pool_build_lapsed_count":0,"tool_pool_moved_at_lapse_count":0,"tool_pool_limit_ms":30000,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":356,"process_wall_ms_streaming":5977,"main_stream_count":4,"main_stream_event_count":247,"main_stream_chunk_count":194,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":356,"wall_ms":5977,"entries":4},"tool":{"cpu_ms":54,"wall_ms":233,"entries":3},"first_event_wait":{"cpu_ms":255,"wall_ms":3578,"entries":4},"b